ፓ ጎኦቢ ቃዛኒ ታ ዔቃንዳኔ» ጋዓኔ።","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳኮ ሃጊ ማዓንዳ ዎዞ ቃኣላ ጉሙርቂንታያኬ፤","poem":1},{"text":"ናኣቦ ታሚዳ ላንካይ ማይንቲ ሼኤሾና ቢራ ዓንጊጉዲ ጌኤሺኬ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ናንጊና ናንጋ ጎዳሢዮ!","poem":1},{"text":"ኔኤኒ ቢያ ዎዴ ኑና ካፔ፤","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ፑርታ ማዔ ሃያ ዎዶ ዓሶይዳፓ ኔ ኑና ዓውሴ።","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ፑርታ ማዺሢ ዓሲ ጋላቲሳ ዎዴይዳ","poem":1},{"text":"ፑርቶ ማዻ ዓሳ ዖቶርቂ ታኣካኔ።","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/mdy_twf/PSA/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}